  "financial_need_statement": "My father drives a rickshaw and earns about 32,000 rupees a month, and my mother does not have paid work. My maternal uncle, who is my guardian for this application, adds about 20,000 rupees from his clerk salary. Together we pay rent, food and my brothers' school fees, and my nursing fee of 85,000 rupees a semester is beyond what the family can manage. With this help I can stay in the nursing program.",
  "life_goal": "My goal is to become a registered nurse and later a nursing teacher, so that more young women in my community can train for safe, respected work in hospitals and clinics.",
